  "text": "This empathetic management automation keeps distributed engineering teams healthy, motivated, and fully engaged. Without casual desk check-ins, managers mistake frantic late-night messages for high productivity rather than distress. Silent overwork rapidly turns into cynicism, devastating team cohesion and spiking costly turnover across engineering squads. Scheduling automated Culture Amp pulse bots directly inside Slack prompts teammates to flag blockers safely. You build high-trust culture while boosting talent retention.",
